---
title: Thanks for contacting me
layout: base.njk
---

<p>Please fill out the form below to contact me.</p>
<p>You can also find me on <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/michaelpolom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
<form class="contact" action="/contact" method="POST">
  <div>
    <label for="name">Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
  </div>
  <div>
    <label for="email">Email</label>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
  </div>
  <div>
    <label for="message">Your message</label>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
  </div>
  <button type="submit">Send</button>
</form>